# GeoScholar

A local retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) assistant for remote sensing research papers.

## Status
Week 1: naive RAG from scratch (NumPy search + local LLM via Ollama) over ~50 arXiv abstracts.
See `notebooks/01_naive_rag.ipynb`.

## Roadmap
- [x] Naive RAG baseline
- [ ] Full-text ingestion + vector database
- [ ] Hybrid search + reranking, with evaluation
- [ ] Grounded answers with citations + answer evaluation
- [ ] API, UI and Docker packaging